      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e1_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "4:10 PM · Your mother hasn’t stopped crying since you told the probate lawyer NOT to release half of your late father’s $450,000 payout to her new husband, Greg.",
